    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mathieu Forgues",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118011988213563788683/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKDI1MuhACbss73ml_0LMnwH_-XBKLBmOyF20COuxGN2ulWtA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend Jonathan and his team. He is experienced and a true professional, not a rookie like so many agents. He can be trusted and is extremely accessible by phone or text message. He was able to advise us on how to sell our house for the top price and the process was very smooth and not stressful. We bought our new house as well with Jonathan and there's NO way we could of done it without him in the current market. He has a proven method that works and so many connections that are key to making successful transactions. Without hesitation, I would choose Jonathan again for selling/buying!!!",
        "time": 1611855280,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chris Causey",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116720069867737406575/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzbNJ8kvAdrBFYfDmRKTfEdR9ayYX9vL-VZfFWC9vx8RkdXoNr=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I cannot recommend Jonathan Mailhot highly enough! He recently helped my elderly mother sell her home and the entire process was seamless, professional and very efficient.  From the beginning Jonathan demonstrated a deep market knowledge, excellent communication skills and a genuine commitment to getting the best outcome for my mom.\n\nJonathan took the time to explain every step of the process, provided expert advice and was always available to answer questions and offer solutions.  He made what could have been a stressful experience very smooth and enjoyable because of his great career experience and expertise.\n\nIf you're looking for a realtor that will take care of his client, look no further!  I'm so grateful for his help and wouldn't hesitate to work with him again.",
        "time": 1741195782,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maia Segev-Diner",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117015425506179375927/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVmmjTBT7z-NaOLt8mw371yH9cmxDjwDVoaRqE7w5q_wfgwxDLk8A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Jonathan Mailhot gave us excellent service, his professional guidance and recommendations as well as honest and genuine approach helped us find our dream home in a matter of just a few days! We can't recommend enough Jonathan Mailhot, if you are looking for an honest and trustworthy agent to sell or purchase your next home, contact Jonathan as he will provide excellent service! Thank you so much for all you have done for our family, its truly been a pleasure, and a great experience having you as our agent , and friend! : )",
        "time": 1687824250,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "DJ Buk",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107846039513679296304/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJhou_2VB0GNImIMAC-69_a7h4FahEUdGHFPXUXuv2P-rucDA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We really connected with Jonathan and he was very dedicated to us finding the right home during a very busy sales time. He was very knowledgeable and accommodating setting up multiple visits last minute at requests. Fully bilingual and very responsive!! We would def refer and use him again!\nThank you so much Jonathan -Denise &Peter",
        "time": 1721600004,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Leks MacD",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105171409519808564895/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9tiMw-cdRS_VbRYPpZ0hbCvAxyXRuGAEYC5L3ERjbKcMDel8I=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "My husband and I had a fantastic experience with Jonathan Mailhot! He was accommodating to coordinate multiple home visits in one day, professional to communicate with, and patient with all our questions as first time home buyers. He wasn't bias, he always gave us choices when we asked for his recommendation. Jonathan is amazing!",
